805
00:28:13.200 --> 00:28:17.760
And every episode, if we learn something new about them, it gets put in the Bible.

806
00:28:18.000 --> 00:28:18.240
Yes.

807
00:28:18.380 --> 00:28:19.860
So it says our job.

